@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed — Concurrent reference replacement conflict resolution
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Receive intended replacement with expected association version;
:Validate new artifact usability and current authority;
:Protect new reference against deletion;
:Acquire actual owner/version coordination;
if (Expected association still current?) then (yes)
 :Commit exact intended association switch;
 :Finalize new protection;
 :Release old association only if no longer required;
else (no)
 :Report conflict; preserve old association;
 :Reconcile candidate protection using actual no-commit evidence;
endif
:Retain all other publication / submission / attachment protections;
stop

@enduml
